//
// Owning domain  : Content Delivery (chora_delivery database)
// Owning team    : Team 2 (Delivery)
// Topic prefix   : chora.delivery.test_set.*
//
// TestSet is a curated, point-weighted collection of Questions (authored in
// chora-creation). Once PUBLISHED the question list is immutable (ADR-155 D5).
// Cross-domain reference: each TestSetQuestion holds a UUIDv7
// question_atom_id pointing into chora_creation.questions (no FK; existence
// validated via gRPC at add-time).
//
// Five topics defined here:
//
//   chora.delivery.test_set.created.v1           — POST /test-sets lands
//   chora.delivery.test_set.question_added.v1    — POST /{id}/questions
//   chora.delivery.test_set.question_updated.v1  — PUT  /{id}/questions/{qId}
//   chora.delivery.test_set.question_removed.v1  — DELETE /{id}/questions/{qId}
//   chora.delivery.test_set.published.v1         — POST /{id}/publish
//
// Append-only after publish: PublishedTestSet.question_count + total_points
// are immutable from that point — any subsequent question_added/_updated/
// _removed event for the same test_set_id is a protocol violation.
//
// EVERY event message embeds chora.common.v1.EventEnvelope as field 1.
